.TH "nvme_init_lm_track_receive" 9 "nvme_init_lm_track_receive" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_lm_track_receive \- Initialize passthru command for Track Receive command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_lm_track_receive
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u8 sel "  ","
.BI "__u16 cntlid "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sel" 12
Select (SEL): This field specifies the type of management
operation to perform.
.IP "cntlid" 12
Controller Identifier (CNTLID): Specifies the identifier of
the controller for which the tracked memory changes, if any,
are to be returned. Used by the Tracked Memory Changes
management operation.
.IP "data" 12
Pointer to data buffer
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Track Receive command.
